key.aoc.tooltip.entity=Culls entity rendering only when AOC has a safe visibility result; entities remain alive and active.
key.aoc.tooltip.tile=Frustum-culls TileEntities and optionally hides fully occluded ones; they remain loaded and active.
key.aoc.tooltip.particle=Stops distant or off-frustum particles from entering the client particle manager.
key.aoc.tooltip.effect=Reserved for client-only visual-effect policies that do not change gameplay state.
key.aoc.tooltip.occlusion=Hides an object only when opaque blocks block all sampled visibility points.
key.aoc.tooltip.distance=Controls the AOC client-side visibility range for this category.
key.aoc.tooltip.budget=Limits AOC world ray checks performed per client tick.
key.aoc.tooltip.extra_range=Adds up to 128 blocks to the vanilla entity render range without changing entity state.
key.aoc.tooltip.reset=Restores the AOC default settings.
